Z||000002||redneckerson||11-18-2001||02:10 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by redneckerson:<BR><B>Ok How do I get this dang alternator out of my '86 6 cyl. SE? I have it all disconnected and the passenger side wheel and inner fender somewhat apart.  Please Help!!!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Nevermind I removed the heat sheilds and disconnected the dogbone and used the stock scissor jack to make myself enuff room to extract the alt. Thank You!!!<BR>||||reg||6
